BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cloud-native-bern-november-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261121T132509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261126T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261126T190000
SUMMARY:Cloud Native Bern Meetup — November 2026
LOCATION:Puzzle ITC\, Belpstrasse 37\, Bern
DESCRIPTION:Two talks and an apéro hosted by Puzzle: wiring Amazon RDS to 
 TimescaleDB with foreign data wrappers for federated Postgres on EKS — a
 nd where 10 TB starts to break it — then PostFinance on moving cloud and
  AI cost awareness earlier\, and what AI cost governance takes.\n\nOrganis
 er: Cloud Native Bern\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents
 .ch/events/cloud-native-bern-november-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/cloud-native-bern-november-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wordpress-bern-111-kamikaze-ki-keynote-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261121T132509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261126T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261126T200000
SUMMARY:Kamikaze-KI-Keynote: KI baut live eine WordPress-Seite
LOCATION:Impact Hub Bern\, Spitalgasse 28 (hybrid)
DESCRIPTION:Stefan Gilgen runs a live\, unrehearsed experiment in which sev
 eral AI models write the text\, generate the images and assemble a complet
 e website on stage\, with a candid look at which models he uses day to day
  and what breaks along the way.\n\nOrganiser: WordPress Bern\n\nDetails an
 d registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/wordpress-bern-111-kamik
 aze-ki-keynote-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/wordpress-bern-111-kamikaze-ki-keynot
 e-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
